Third-party code, models and data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Derived code
  The training and evaluation harness descends from the public SAC implementation
  (Autoencoding-Free Context Compression for LLMs via Contextual Semantic Anchors).
  Matryoshka tokens, the Elastic Allocator, the tolerance-conditioned objective,
  and oracle labeling are additions made here.

Backbones
  Llama 3.1 / Llama 3.2 models are subject to the Meta Llama community license.
  Qwen2.5 models are subject to the Qwen license. Model weights are not
  distributed in this repository.

Datasets
  MRQA 2019 (multi-dataset reading comprehension), PG-19 and SlimPajama are used
  under their respective licenses and are not redistributed here. Each
  constituent MRQA dataset (SQuAD, NewsQA, TriviaQA, SearchQA, HotpotQA,
  NaturalQuestions, BioASQ, DROP, DuoRC, RACE, RelationExtraction, TextbookQA)
  carries its own terms.

Libraries
  PyTorch, Hugging Face transformers / tokenizers / datasets / accelerate,
  NumPy and the other packages pinned in requirements.txt are used under their
  own licenses.
